e":"王齮","kind":"person","person_id":"2wl_dla_w69","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji006-006","person_id":"2wl_dla_w69","title":"將軍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p001","quote":"秦始皇帝者，秦莊襄王子也。莊襄王為秦質子於趙，見呂不韋姬，悅而取之，生始皇。以秦昭王四十八年正月生於邯鄲。及生，名為政，姓趙氏。年十三歲，莊襄王死，政代立為秦王。當是之時，秦地已并巴、蜀、漢中，越宛有郢，置南郡矣；北收上郡以東，有河東、太原、上黨郡；東至滎陽，滅二周，置三川郡。呂不韋為相，封十萬戶，號曰文信侯。招致賓客游士，欲以并天下。李斯為舍人。蒙驁、王齮、麃公等為將軍。王年少，初即位，委國事大臣。晉陽反。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji006-006:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p001","start":185,"end":187,"surface":"將軍","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m001-0178","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"即位與明言封號分記；為相、舍人、將軍只記開篇任職見證，不補任命年份或以死亡推終點。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[{"id":"shiji-015-r230-c02-m002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"王齮","person_id":"2wl_dla_w69","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依國別、紀年及原格上下文暫定；保留異文，不據同名自動合併。","table_id":"shiji-015","table_fragment_id":"shiji-015-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-015-r230","table_cell_id":"shiji-015-r230-c02","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-015","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-015","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-015","source_revision":"2607002","kind":"table_person_mention","quote":"三。王齮擊上黨。初置太原郡。魏公子無忌率五國卻我軍河外，蒙驁解去，"},{"id":"shiji-015-r233-c01-m012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"王齮","person_id":"2wl_dla_w69","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依國別、紀年及原格上下文暫定；保留異文，不據同名自動合併。","table_id":"shiji-015","table_fragment_id":"shiji-015-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji